--
Nested Classes:
- Datum
  --
  - id: int
  - wikiDataId: String
  - type: String
  - city: String
  - name: String
  - country: String
  - countryCode: String
  - region: String
  - regionCode: String
  - latitude: double
  - longitude: double
  - population: int
  --
  
- Link
  --
  - rel: String
  - href: String
  --

- Metadata
  --
  - currentOffset: int
  - totalCount: int
  --

- Root
  --
  - data: ArrayList&lt;Datum&gt;
  - links: ArrayList&lt;Link&gt;
  - metadata: Metadata
--
Class fetches city suggestion based on prefix or coordinates.
Used to give suggestion if user's inserted location not found and also retrive corrent location for weather items, since it is not possible to filer only city names using Geocoding API.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>1192</x><y>328</y><w>288</w><h>128</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>GeoAPI
